{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_148_1000_p", "source_sha256": "1c41016abb3715b29866584d40938252fd01a4334df178032ceb5dc074e81f9a", "ja": "（さて、そろそろ次の公演についての計画を……\nえーと、次は……）", "zh": "（那么，接下来该计划一下下一场公演的事了……\n呃，下一场是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_148_1001_se", "source_sha256": "8eb363af7a4988b86bfee0510c7f10ec1d6443e74df9ed837c329ebe0e386b59", "ja": "ガチャ！", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_148_1003_p", "source_sha256": "973639b01bb2d930392ca4ef4a987431bca3b053289bf092ce9056f0684095e4", "ja": "あ、響。どうした？", "zh": "啊，响。怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_148_1004_013hib", "source_sha256": "0939cd042ef09ba166cf4ec449762d7ccf75ece3dc90bf2240fcd2ce36ed670f", "ja": "こないだの公演の映像、実家に送ってくれたの！？\nにーにーから連絡が来て……びっくりしたぞ！", "zh": "你把上次公演的录像寄回老家了吗！？\n哥哥联系我了……吓了我一跳！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_148_1005_p", "source_sha256": "3be3df4939cebbe83c4c5d3b8a326bae09c757328efb767ee0c71b6e505adc03", "ja": "ああ、せっかくだからと思って。\n……感想が届いたのか？", "zh": "是啊，想着难得有这个机会嘛。\n……他把感想寄来了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_148_1006_013hib", "source_sha256": "ed9b89e934e34b1a081b75ed0d43bdfa4282142931ff9b48b1ff896bf75850c7", "ja": "うん、しかも「すごかった」って……。自分、\nにーにーにアイドルで褒められたの、初めてだぞ！？", "zh": "嗯，而且还说了“太厉害了”……自己\n因为偶像的工作被哥哥夸奖，这还是头一次呢！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_148_1007_p", "source_sha256": "3b3cfa6829ff3d9b7ad3b269d7146c8098dee087fa618623a9b5a95132afa3a1", "ja": "へえ、よかったじゃないか。\nきっと響が頑張ってるのが伝わったんだな。", "zh": "哦，那不是很好吗？\n肯定是因为响的努力传达给对方了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_148_1008_013hib", "source_sha256": "0dc751551fdcd43c8516223ebcabf0498c43a72e54caaa4c62509f5ce86264b6", "ja": "そ、そうなのかな？　……そっか。", "zh": "是、是这样吗？……这样啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_148_1009_013hib", "source_sha256": "d000e46a8557c74508a44bc63ab27f1aaae25e3a3bba3b29d773ee7303303a89", "ja": "にーにーは、自分が沖縄を出る時も、\nすぐ帰って来るに決まってる～とか言ってたんだけど。", "zh": "哥哥在我离开冲绳的时候，也说过“肯定很快就会回来的～”之类的话。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_148_1010_013hib", "source_sha256": "2d6099c5ece0c59c25e11b32556037e27e106067d81073c2741efb3532d4ed33", "ja": "でも、これで少しは見返せたのかもね……えへへ。\nあ、でも自分はまだ、全然満足してないぞ！", "zh": "不过，这样一来，或许也算稍微争回了口气吧……嘿嘿。\n啊，不过我还完全没有满足呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_148_1011_013hib", "source_sha256": "535ea2cf9832797e832da2cf4e518c994c8f106c70aad9ae399a9b746c98a602", "ja": "早くトップアイドルになって、地元に凱旋して！\nにーにーの鼻を、カンペキに明かしてやるさー！", "zh": "快点成为顶尖偶像，衣锦还乡吧！\n让哥哥彻底对我刮目相看啦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_148_1012_p", "source_sha256": "725e48f12bdae56d7baeed2d1f61a0d7acab4600aa21fd4f0acf912e33bbccd7", "ja": "ああ、響なら夢じゃない。\nこれからも全力でサポートさせてもらうよ！", "zh": "啊，如果是响的话，就不是梦想。\n今后也请让我全力支持你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_148_1013_p", "source_sha256": "e521eed914d233af81b68d10a377f1c4d014c7fd7195bda1bcac8efa18b586d8", "ja": "……ところで、今日はまだいいのか？\nもうこんな時間だけど。", "zh": "……话说回来，今天这样还没问题吗？\n已经这个时间了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_148_1014_013hib", "source_sha256": "b2ed866d7bddccbfb83668343872af411ec28e9e23f0c5e32e0f4e697acbc684", "ja": "えっ？　……ああっ、いぬ美たちのご飯の時間！\n帰らなきゃ！", "zh": "欸？……啊！到犬美它们吃饭的时间了！得回去了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_148_1015_013hib", "source_sha256": "23b2be3cdca730c104407b9cd30583182bb19ec16ddf4a3740ce9e301534ca49", "ja": "教えてくれてありがとねっ、{$P$}！\nそれじゃ……。", "zh": "谢谢你告诉我，{$P$}！\n那么……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
